      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINDORAH (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Speedy Jude (30.37) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including two wins, from six starts. One of the leading chances. TREBLE BEERS (3) was below best last time finishing seventh at Sandown, but prior to that had been racing well including a T3 Grade 5 H win two back at Sandown. Expected to bounce back to best. REV IAN (2) last start finished 4th over 525m at this track beaten 6 lengths (30.97) behind Tiger Rocks in a Grade 5 on November 11. Can feature with the right run. WINNING RATIO (7) recorded a speedy 24.09 win last start. In form and worth including.",
